WEBVTT

00:11:25.412 --> 00:11:30.109
and creating a context 
for research and innovation.

00:11:30.109 --> 00:11:35.739
Can you tell us about what the Foundation 
has built specifically in this field

00:11:35.739 --> 00:11:38.329
and what are the main areas of focus?

00:11:38.821 --> 00:11:41.751
So, research is a very key element
of the Foundation.

00:11:41.751 --> 00:11:46.272
That's why it is called Qatar Foundation
for Education, Science

00:11:46.272 --> 00:11:47.541
and Community Development

00:11:47.541 --> 00:11:50.796
So, science or research come actually

00:11:50.796 --> 00:11:53.558
in a very important pillar 
of the Foundation,

00:11:53.558 --> 00:11:59.026
and from the inception, 
the research aspect was crucial

00:11:59.026 --> 00:12:02.896
in the way the Foundation has even 
attracted educational partners.